{"parse": {"title": "冰原时隙-03", "pageid": 107410, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-02\" title=\"冰原时隙-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">冰原时隙-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-04\" title=\"冰原时隙-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">冰原时隙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E4.B8.AA.E6.9C.BA.E4.BC.9A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一个机会\">一个机会</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一个机会</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Opportunity</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠激烈地挥舞着爪子，号召企鹅朋友们团聚到自己的身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>都到我背后来，伙计们！你们看不见吗？面具……她长出了面具！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉浅橄榄色的瞳孔因为紧张而微微放大，她抬手摸了摸自己的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我警告你们别过来——别小看松鼠和企鹅，我们会狠狠踢你的屁股！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉放下手，看了看空无一人的身后，慢慢地呼出一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……谵妄？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>认真地计算了一下力度，中尉一记手刀，精准地敲在了张牙舞爪的松鼠脖子后面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>呜哇！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_kekaozhan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_kekaozhan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嚼嚼松果睁开眼睛，发现自己被一条皮带五花大绑，牢牢固定在一张木桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周围散落着狰狞的人类工具和不可名状的药品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>哦不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>嘿，中尉，亏我还以为你是个好人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我就知道人类都靠不住，你想做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军靴声响起，一双浅橄榄色的眼睛俯低在它视线上空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>根据我掌握的神秘学知识，松鼠并不具备解剖价值，也不能产出神秘材料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>可我是神秘学松鼠，别把我说得一文不值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>那三只帝企鹅的名字是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>什么名字……等等，嘿！它们是阿德利企鹅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>是的。测试通过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉解开了松鼠身上的束缚带，毛绒绒的小神秘学家立刻跳了起来，紧张地左右张望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎嘎嘎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-311501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>太好了，伙计们，你们没事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">企鹅：</div><div>嘎嘎嘎，嘎嘎嘎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>什么，我又发疯了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>所以说，这并不是第一次发作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>是的，是的。自从遇到那群面具怪人之后，哥们儿可就交了坏运气啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>遇到了他们之后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉若有所思，但随即恢复了正常的表情，拿起了旁边的医疗箱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我已经给企鹅们都包扎过了，现在该轮到你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>谢谢你，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我说过吗，中尉？你是我来南极之后遇到的唯一一个好人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>是的。在你指认我是面具怪人并攻击我之前五分钟，你说过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嚼嚼松果尴尬地用爪尖挠了挠耳朵后面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我也不知道我身上发生了什么，企鹅朋友们说，我最近偶尔就会这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>胡言乱语，攻击空气，什么的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-311511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>呜哇！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-312110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-312110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-312110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>需要轻一点吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>……不，这一点儿都不疼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为了证明自己或转移注意力，它主动试图开启话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>还没问过你们的番号，中尉。或许我应该给你寄一封感谢信，让他们挂在走廊里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-312114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-312114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-312114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>噢，我是不是说错话了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>没关系，可以理解。如果一支部队都跑到南极来了，他们在执行什么秘密任务我都不会觉得惊讶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>感谢你的理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>所以你们真的是在执行秘密任务？老天，这可真刺激。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>作为对你善意的回报，如果你需要帮忙的话，可以来找我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>帮忙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉下意识地看了看手表，距离士兵们结束预定的休息时间还有四个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>如果能有四支搜救小队……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正向的可能性让她不禁用更严格的目光审视松鼠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓬松的毛发，在雪地中只会越发显眼的伪装色，她认识这只来自佛罗里达的啮齿类动物还不超过一个小时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她无法就这样托付一条年轻的生命，甚至更多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>拜托，我喜欢帮得上忙。你看，我本来应该在那个最好的等待室里享受阳光，可我现在带着企鹅朋友们在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>所以，你是为了送这些企鹅回家，才会跨越半个地球来到南极。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>回家？不，不，我没有这么高尚的情怀，我是在救它们的命——当时只有我帮得上忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你们是朋友吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>现在当然是了，我们可是一伙儿的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>热情快活，胆大包天的小家伙。张扬大胆，富有正义感和责任心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉点了点头。毛绒绒的小家伙并不知道，它已经在无意间通过了一项测试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>很感谢你的好意。请给我一些时间，我需要规划一些路线，并做出决策。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>哦，好，当然。做什么决定都不该太草率。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠略显茫然地看着中尉加快了包扎的速度，并快速收拾好了医疗用具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>你要决策什么来着的，中尉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>比如我们的合作方式和具体的行动计划。你和你的朋友可以稍微休息一会儿，我会尽快回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉提前做出了许诺，这不符合常规程序，但她会处理好。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "冰原时隙-03"}}